Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}本字幕由悠哈璃羽字幕社製作，僅用於日語交流使用\N請勿私自二次上傳及用作商業用途
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fade(500,500)\blur3}翻譯:阿恁&雪音  校對:狗糧山  時軸:懶鬼後裔樰七  後期:冷麵珺  壓製:zoe  海報:狗糧山
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:10.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聖誕節啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:13.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,想送點什麼給冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:19.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首飾麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.15,0:00:24.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐她好像一直都戴耳飾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.49,0:00:26.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝惠顧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.12,0:00:31.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,買下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,希望冬月小姐喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.86,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1225.333,761.333)}第8話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.86,0:00:54.86,Koori-title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,900)\blur5\pos(1477.333,833.333)}妹妹登場！滑雪場過聖誕節
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:01:00.48,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}冷たい指先感じられる距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.89,0:01:00.48,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}能感受到指尖冰涼的距離感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:06.56,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}もどかしくて少し切ない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:06.56,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}令人急不可待  又有些許愁緒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:12.57,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}ひとつずつ灯る街灯に呼応して
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:12.57,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}與一盞盞點亮的路燈遙相呼應
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:18.42,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}募っていく気持ちに気付いた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.71,0:01:18.42,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,, {\blur5\fade(300,300)}覺察到心中一點點積攢的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:26.07,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,照れ隠してもクールぶっても {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:26.07,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,不管是遮羞  抑或是裝酷 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.96,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,見透かされそう {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:28.96,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,都像會被看透似的 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.12,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,やさしく {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.12,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,溫柔地 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.37,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Freeze for a minute {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:34.37,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,凍結一分鐘 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.38,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,心ごと {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.38,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,全心全意 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:43.50,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,I miss you 言わせたくて {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:43.50,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,想讓你說  我想你 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.66,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Let me love you honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.73,0:01:46.66,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,讓我愛你  honey {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:49.69,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,言えない for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:49.69,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,說不出口  for real {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:57.68,Koori-OP-JP,,0,0,0,,いつか言葉にできたら {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:57.68,Koori-OP-CN,,0,0,0,,假如有朝一日能說出口 {\blur5\fade(300,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.75,Koori-picture4,,0,0,0,,{\frz288.1\pos(224,714)\fad(0,400)}青春由純白開啟——
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,憧憬已久的活動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:30.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:34.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,標語過於應景了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,天氣真好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:43.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一片純白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.42,0:02:45.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.70,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,滑雪  滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.89,0:02:51.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,今天  四個人一起來滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:02:56.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是一週前的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.28,0:03:04.78,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,中獎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.79,0:03:02.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  快看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.54,0:03:03.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,鏘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我中獎了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.97,0:03:08.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎  一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:13.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可我沒滑過雪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.58,0:03:15.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,邀請別人比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不要不要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:22.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,既然沒有滑過更加要去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:26.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一定會有新發現啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,如果滑得開心  就是新發現
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:35.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就算超級無聊  也是新發現啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,也是呢  那請務必算上我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.16,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.84,0:03:49.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.02,0:03:51.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.10,0:03:54.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生會滑雪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.98,0:03:57.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嗯  還行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:03:59.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:05.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麼  能請你教教冬月小姐滑雪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冬月小姐一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:15.55,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,早啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.89,0:04:21.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好嘞  機會難得  晚上大家一起開聖誕派對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聖誕節…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,大家一起來一場滑雪旅行！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:40.31,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我想確認一下你的腳是不是固定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能稍微抬一下腳嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:44.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:53.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:55.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和喜歡的人一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:59.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我從未想過在我的人生中會有這樣的大事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.04,0:05:03.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的是  忍不住說起冷笑話來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.20,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,註：日語中「喜歡」與「滑雪」發音相近。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.39,0:05:05.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和喜歡的人一起滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:08.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  冰室先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:10.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:14.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  給你添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:18.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒事  我很擅長滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:22.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麻煩你教我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.91,0:05:25.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.85,0:05:30.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首先從簡單的地方教起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:31.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:35.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,先試試唰一下滑下去  然後啪一下停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,唰…啪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我先示範給你看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:46.12,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就這樣  唰一下滑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啪一下停住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:57.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很簡單的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:05:59.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你先試試
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:11.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啪嘰…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:18.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,太可愛了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:24.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  抱歉  唰一下有點難以做到…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:28.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,糟糕了  以前我都是自然而然就會滑的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:30.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,壓根不知道怎麼教人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.23,0:06:34.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,而且我聽的教學是全用擬聲詞的關西腔導遊中心說明啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.95,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這條路要是唰地下去得擱那兒砰地撞上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你得從這兒嗶一下轉過去才成
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.72,0:06:44.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抓住這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:46.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.30,0:06:49.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我把你拉起來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.40,0:06:59.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,首先  想要穩住重心  維持前傾的姿勢就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:03.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,前傾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:08.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然後  將滑雪板擺成內八字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這樣就不會滑得太快  不用怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,內八字
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不錯不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:20.54,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,然後  慢慢將重心移動到前方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:21.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,重心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,再滑遠一點試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.16,0:07:30.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:37.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,就是這樣  做得不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.49,0:07:41.16,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,可以的可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:57.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厲害  冬月小姐你已經會滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.11,0:08:01.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真了不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.67,0:08:02.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.00,0:08:08.24,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生狀態極佳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.11,0:08:16.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麼  冬月小姐也會滑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.75,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們大家上去看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:22.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,上面小屋的咖哩好像很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:26.08,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  我們去上面休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:32.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是腳印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:34.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的誒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:37.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是…狐狸吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:42.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  那是我媽媽的腳印
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.03,0:08:46.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,媽媽是  毛茸茸的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:50.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,歡迎回家  飯做好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:55.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  下次我能去你老家玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:09:01.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我開玩笑的  她就是個普通的阿姨啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你信了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.38,0:09:14.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,話說  我很好奇冰室先生的家人是什麼樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.16,0:09:18.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的父母都是普通的工薪階層
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:21.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來是普通的工薪階層
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:24.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,妹妹也是普通的學生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.42,0:09:28.79,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  原來你有妹妹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:29.70,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生有妹妹啊  我都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.10,0:09:37.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雖然和冰室先生一起工作已經有一段時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:40.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還有很多事情是我不知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.49,0:09:47.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來  她好像說過冬天的時候會在某個滑雪場打工
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:50.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  不會是這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,要真在這裡我很想見見呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對吧  冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.21,0:09:56.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,, 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:10:00.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,應該…不會那麼巧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:05.27,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生的妹妹  是怎樣的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:13.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我們一起吃咖哩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不錯誒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.46,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,誒  哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等一下  你為什麼在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:27.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.52,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真  真就有這麼巧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個…這是我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:40.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這就是冰室妹妹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:43.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你們好  我叫雪泯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:47.65,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,現在在做讀者模特和自媒體等等
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,讀模和自媒體？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:53.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪泯  跟人家才第一次見面好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.03,0:10:56.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也有拍關於跳舞和化妝的視頻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,還算小有人氣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:03.15,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,化妝視頻？  想看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.41,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是什麼頻道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:11.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,抱歉  不想讓現實裡認識的人看見
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:15.37,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是「雪泯Channel」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:18.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哇  有很多粉絲誒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:20.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.18,0:11:22.67,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:25.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這麼有人氣  沒必要藏起來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:31.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  因為  播放次數最高的視頻是吃播…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(690.667,223.333)}魔鬼辣大胃王挑戰！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(389.334,532.667)}第1名  {\c&H090706&\3c&HFFFFFF&}雪泯Channel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.92,Koori-picture10,,0,0,0,,{\fs100\pos(386.667,628.667)\c&H0B19E8&}魔鬼辣{\c&H090706&}大胃王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的誒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:38.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,畢竟吃播跟我計劃中的路線不太相符
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:41.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我覺得很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:46.20,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,難道你就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:47.81,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:48.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:52.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,果然  我經常聽哥哥提起…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:53.11,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,等會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,別鬧  哥  你突然撲上來幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:59.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你才是  打算講些啥啊  幹活去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:02.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很遺憾  我現在剛好是休息時間
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.43,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,剛好？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.30,0:12:08.57,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥不許過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,略略略
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那  那個
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.93,0:12:17.49,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聽我說  冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.62,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我只是有點擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:26.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女的後裔反倒性子會很急
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.59,0:12:30.04,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥在公司沒有給你們添麻煩吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.05,0:12:33.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪女一族原來有這樣的血脈特點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:36.80,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,怎麼能說是麻煩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:41.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不如說  我一直受到冰室先生的關照
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他今天還教了我滑雪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.19,0:12:48.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎  他在公司沒有飄飄然嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:55.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能和冰室先生共事  是我的榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.53,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她和冰室先生的瞳色一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.20,0:13:22.78,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:26.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,別鬧啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.11,0:13:31.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,自來熟也得有個度吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,放開我  哥哥什麼都要管嘮叨死了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.97,0:13:39.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這傢伙  不會是真的看上冬月小姐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.11,0:13:46.90,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聖誕快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:50.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐  有什麼我能幫忙的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.55,0:13:50.48,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,我還想趕緊再去滑雪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:51.62,Koori-an8,,0,0,0,,確實啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.28,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒事  交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:55.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  你能在公司造個滑雪場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.04,0:13:56.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說不定真行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:01.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麼現在  章魚燒派對正式開幕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:07.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聖誕帽  也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.13,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,為什麼要在雪山上開章魚燒派對
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:14.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為前幾天我買了做章魚燒的機器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:21.61,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這裡的小屋也有廚具  我就說機會難得我們辦一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:26.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我還在想冬月小姐的行李怎麼那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:29.30,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.53,0:14:33.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,對章魚燒派對這麼有熱情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,絕對會很開心的  這不是很好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:39.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,給你  冴島先生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:45.00,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,嘛  這種倒也不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.84,0:14:51.09,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,你是不是體質原因不能吃熱的東西？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:51.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:54.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我最喜歡章魚燒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.84,0:14:57.92,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,只要是你做的什麼我都吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:14:59.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:11.05,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那聖誕老人冬月  會格外給你的章魚燒多加點料哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:18.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,聖誕老人冬月  簡直就是天使
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:21.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,活著真好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:25.17,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生  在室內就別搞這齣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:32.14,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,烤盤溫度很高  大家小心燙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:36.33,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,按照步驟  安全無虞地舉辦章魚燒派對
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我說  在這之前我們不乾個杯嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.03,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,啊  不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.32,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,章魚燒奉行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.85,0:15:44.32,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,註：奉行，日本武家時代擔任行政事務的武士官名。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:46.85,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:26.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  酒快喝完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.50,0:16:29.42,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那我去買點回來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:32.89,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我也和你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:35.56,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,麻煩你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:42.35,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,說起來  喵梅洛怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:45.18,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我託付給寄養的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,它有在好好看家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:51.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是的  它是個好孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:11.26,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是…啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.78,0:17:15.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冬月小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這個  請收下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:32.59,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.23,0:17:35.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為今天是聖誕節
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:40.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是聖誕老人冰室…送的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:42.06,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:46.83,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:53.72,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒準備  你還這麼費心…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.75,0:17:58.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,因為我總是引起風雪  把辦公室弄得很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,一點都不冷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和冰室先生在一起一直都很…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:10.38,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不可思議地  心裡會感到溫暖
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.67,0:18:16.47,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.74,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,為什麼冰室先生要謝我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:26.48,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  為什麼呢  忍不住就脫口而出了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.29,0:18:30.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我才是  謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.71,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,他們兩個  好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:51.97,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀  也挺好的啦  雪景很漂亮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.51,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊  很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:32.23,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真的嗎  討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:36.01,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,送對方不喜歡的首飾  是最不討好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.50,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,會讓人覺得明明還沒交往卻搞這麼正式
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:43.44,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.58,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我得送點感覺更輕鬆的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.36,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,很暖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:20:01.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那個  很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.79,0:20:03.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,昨天我妹妹吵吵鬧鬧的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:05.34,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,沒有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.69,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,小雪泯  是個很貼心的孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:13.19,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,她問我哥哥在公司上班順不順利  很擔心你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:14.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:22.87,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,在小雪泯面前  你和平時表現得有些不一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:24.84,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:28.39,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,和在公司裡不一樣  有種很新鮮的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:31.68,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,作為哥哥的冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:34.91,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,滑雪很拿手的冰室先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.75,0:20:37.94,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,是我的新發現
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.19,0:20:41.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,能一起來滑雪真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:44.76,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,我的榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:49.63,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,巴士裡好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:51.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哎呀哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-p1,,0,0,0,,{\p1\fscx119\fscy160\fad(300,0)\pos(739.599,834.266)}m 0 0 l 0 -105 l 373 -104 l 373 0
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768.001,687.333)}哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(770.667,730)}------------
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:02.65,Koori-picture8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(773.334,767.333)}有一條新信息
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:07.10,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.66,0:21:12.66,Koori-picture2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1386.667,445.999)}幹得好!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:10.66,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,Good job
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.07,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,噁心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:16.29,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,不懂他什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.25,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,直接已讀不回吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.99,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,度過了一個不錯的聖誕節啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:31.88,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,明年  要是能二人獨處…就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:56.98,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}ふと気づけばまた視線は　追い掛けてしまう君の姿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:56.98,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}突然發覺之時  視線又追逐上你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:12.05,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}嫌なことがあっても心は　雨上がりの空のように
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:12.05,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}即使遇上壞事  心也如雨後初晴的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:25.36,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}君の笑顔はどうしてこんなにも　ポカポカで温かいの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:25.36,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H2A15D3&}你的笑容為何  如此和煦溫暖春風拂面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:33.07,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　君のこと　何でもいいからさ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.59,0:22:33.07,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  只要是關於你什麼都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:40.16,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,好きなこと　好きなもの　私にだけそっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:40.16,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,只悄悄告訴我  你喜歡的事也好物也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:47.77,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,ねぇ、教えて　いつの日か　二人のこの距離を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:47.77,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,告訴我可以嗎  總會有一天我們的距離
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:58.48,Koori-ED-JP,,0,0,0,,少しずつ　少しずつ　なんて少しだけ期待してる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:58.48,Koori-ED-CN,,0,0,0,,我無比期待著  它能一點一點日漸縮短
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.42,0:23:06.73,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,好  接下來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.73,0:23:08.86,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,雪泯Channel的下集預告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.91,0:23:12.96,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,竟然是  直播除夕倒計時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H353222&\3c&HF8F64C&\bord4\fs84}除夕夜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F64C&\3c&HF8FCB9&}雪泯Channel
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F64C&\3c&HECEFA7&\fs90}倒計時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:16.91,Koori-an7,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6032C7&\3c&H999ED2&\fs100}直播決定！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:17.21,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,除夕夜的雪泯Channel就決定是直播倒計時了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.45,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,計劃了很厲害的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.75,0:23:23.40,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,除夕夜就和雪泯一起倒計時吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.36,0:23:29.02,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,那麼  請點擊下面的頻道訂閱和點讚啦
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948.8,842)}戳這裡訂閱本頻道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:27.22,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,{\pos(948.8,842)\bord7\3c&HFFFFFF&}戳這裡訂閱本頻道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.22,0:23:38.60,Koori-text,,0,0,0,,這傢伙  到底要做什麼啊
